    "title": "Students get in free to Southridge athletic event this year, senior citizens get discount - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jill Lyman ,\n7 hours ago HUNTINGBURG, Ind. (WFIE) - There’s good news for students this school year in southwest Dubois County. The Southridge Athletic Department has shared that all Southridge students, grades K-12, will be able to attend all SWDCS athletic events for free. They will also add a discount for senior citizens. Officials... Read full article\n1",
